  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed transaction consists of a Senior Guaranteed loan for up to US$10 million, at a term of 7 years with a grace period of two years and guarantee on assets acceptable to IDB Invest. The funds will be used to finance capital expansion investments to increase crop production and the efficiency of existing operations.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------Amendment:An updated version of the Environmental and Social Action Plan (ESAP) has been published on May 5, 2023.</narrative>
  </description>
